A sequence diagram:

── mermaid · sequence (transcript) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
1. Client ─▸ Server: GET /items
alt cached
  2. Server ┄▸ Client: 304 Not Modified
else fresh
  3. Server ─▸ Server: load items
  4. Server ┄▸ Client: 200 OK
end
Note right of Server: logs every request
